{"message":"I’m sorry you’re dealing with this. Available credit doesn’t always guarantee approval. Common causes include a fraud-protection alert, incorrect card details or CVV, an inactive or expired card, international-transaction restrictions, a merchant terminal problem, or a temporary processing issue.

